From 05729e099768b49d70ad1947b891a7dd796f81bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:31:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Declare kanban completion review and landing
 metadata

Schema-guided xAI reviewers emitted only completion_receipt because metadata declared no verdict fields. Advertise the documented review and landing keys while retaining free-form metadata and all existing completion gates.

Proof: registry test RED KeyError verdict before fix; 21 receipt/schema tests GREEN; 605 consumer tests GREEN; scripts/check 21 checks OK. Live managed grok-4.7/xai-oauth A/B: old schema returned only completion_receipt, fixed returned verdict approve, full synthetic reviewed_sha, reviewed_pr and findings. Neither generated call was executed. Schema budget deliberately increases to 11700 bytes (11564 actual) for contract discoverability.
---
